    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Saga of the Great Wolf",
    "summary": "Friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units with this ability (excluding **MONSTER/VEHICLES** units) get 3 abilities, each working while its doctrine is active for the unit:\n\n- **Encircling Jaws** (**assault doctrine**): **advance rolls** and **charge rolls** get +1.\n- **Hunter’s Eye** (**devastator doctrine**): ranged attacks' **hit rolls** of 1 may be re-rolled.\n- **Ferocious Strike** (**tactical doctrine**): attacks against an enemy unit within 9\" gain **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n\nYour **LOGAN GRIMNAR** units have **Howling Onslaught** (**Once per battle, per army**): you may use it in your Command phase, and friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES MONSTER/VEHICLE** units then also gain **Master of Wolves** until your next Command phase starts.\n\n**Restrictions**: **SPACE WOLVES** units are allowed, but **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units from any other Chapter are not.",
